  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">toffee bars tuck sweet crunch into every bite, echoing sunlit afternoons in grandma’s kitchen. A buttery oat shortbread crumbles like golden sand beneath a glossy caramel layer studded with toffee bits. Melt sugar and butter into silky caramel, pour over the base with a pinch of sea salt for balance, then bake until the edges just begin to brown. As they cool, the pan sets into irresistible, sliceable squares that pair perfectly with a mug of creamy coffee or a glass of vanilla almond milk. Soft, sweet, and simply unforgettable, toffee bars turn any moment into a little celebration.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-toffee-bars\">Why You’ll Love This Toffee Bars</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients-for-toffee-bars\">Ingredients for Toffee Bars</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-toffee-bars\">How to Make Toffee Bars</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-toffee-bars\">Pro Tips for Making Toffee Bars</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-toffee-bars\">How to Serve this Toffee Bars</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-toffee-bars\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This Toffee Bars</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Irresistibly crunchy and chewy texture in every bite.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Simple ingredients make it a breeze to whip up.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfect for sharing at gatherings or keeping all to yourself!</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Customizable with your favorite nuts or chocolate chips.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>A delightful treat that satisfies your sweet tooth without the fuss.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-5317\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"5317\" data-servings=\"12\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column-container wprm-column-gap-20 wprm-column-rows-recipe-600 wprm-column-rows-reverse wprm-row-gap-20 meadow-header-columns\">\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-align-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-image wprm-block-image-rounded\"><img decoding=\"async\" style=\"border-width: 0px;border-style: solid;border-color: #666666;border-radius: 20px;width: 300px;max-width: 100%;height: 300px;object-fit: cover;\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Homemade-Toffee-Bars.webp\" class=\"attachment-999999x300 size-999999x300\" alt=\"Close-up of Toffee Bars topped with chocolate and pecans, served on a wooden platter.\" srcset=\"https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Homemade-Toffee-Bars.webp 500w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Homemade-Toffee-Bars-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.grandmarecipe.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Homemade-Toffee-Bars-150x150.webp 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"wprm-layout-column wprm-column-width-75 wprm-align-rows-center\">\n      <div class=\"wprm-layout-container meadow-header-accent\" style=\"--wprm-layout-container-text-color: var(--meadow-accent-color);\">\n        \n      </div>\n      <h2 class=\"wprm-recipe-name wprm-block-text-bold\">Toffee Bars</h2>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      \n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 15px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-recipe-summary wprm-block-text-normal\">Discover the best toffee bars with our easy recipes! Indulge in sweet success and delight your taste buds today! 🍬✨</div>\n      <div class=\"wprm-spacer\" style=\"height: 20px;\"></div>\n      <div class=\"